  "question": "Which caf\u00e9 is nearest along the way toward the Langham, Chicago, Chicago, IL from Algonquin Woods, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.872175 42.023616)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.627512 41.888424)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.872175 42.023616)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.872175 42.023616)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
